hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1773","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Beshak Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Quraish mein pet na tha magar us mein Aapki rishtedaari thi. To Aap ne farmaya: Magar ye ke tum jodo jo merey aur tumhaarey darmiyaan rishtedaari mein hai. (Bukhari: 4818). Allah Taala ka qaul: (Ae hamaarey Rab! Ham se azaab khol dey, beshak ham imaan laaney waley hain)."
